Per-frequency output & \(\mathrm{Re}/\mathrm{Im}\) of \(\hat x, \overline{\hat y}\) & Pair responses \(\psi_k^T x_k\), \(\phi_k^T y_k\) 
Cross-power product  & \(\hat x \, \overline{\hat y}\) & Bilinear interaction of pair responses \(z_k\) 
Phase extracted & Translation angle \(\omega_k \cdot \Delta\varphi\) & \((\cos\theta_k,\, \sin\theta_k,\, |z_k|)\) 
Transformation model & Global pure translation & Spatially-varying orthogonal \(L_p\) 
