\subsection{Echocardiography (CAMUS)}
\label{sec:camus}
We evaluate on CAMUS \citep{leclerc2019camus} ED\(\rightarrow\)ES reporting LV myocardium Dice as in \citet{zhang2024adacs} (Appendix~\ref{app:camus-protocol}). On CAMUS we deploy two cascaded stages of the same architecture, alternating within a single ODE integration: a coarse stage with effective kernel \(k_f=64\) at stride 8 for the first half of steps, then a fine stage with kernel \(k_f=32\) at stride 4 refining against the coarse-warped image.
